MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 002b9076b5a919941a76b7b86978d20e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 33_Twins_Resolution
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Conversation
  showPanel: 0
  panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  panelColor: {r: 0.06, g: 0.07, b: 0.13, a: 1}
  panelTitle: 
  Lines:
  - text: The bakery returns. Mei and Jian look at the finished mooncake.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I thought you were changing her recipe to hide that you lost it.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I thought you had decided my part didn't matter.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I couldn't remember your part, so I treated it as if it never happened.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I did lose the page. I'm sorry. I thought losing it meant I had failed
      her. And you.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I blamed you because being angry was easier than saying she's gone.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They split the mooncake and taste it. For a moment, neither speaks.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It tastes like her kitchen.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Almost.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Almost is more than I thought we had left.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The Baker places a blank recipe card between them. Mei writes the filling
      and sweetness. Jian adds the centre and finish.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It may not be every word she wrote. It is what the two of you can carry
      forward.
    npcId: 1
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'll keep the tin.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'll keep the recipe. Properly this time.
    npcId: 3
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We'll both keep copies.
    npcId: 2
    style: 0
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
  - text: They leave together. Mei carries the old tin; Jian carries the new recipe.
    npcId: 0
    style: 3
    speakerName: 
    panelImage: {fileID: 0}
